    <div class="caveat"><strong>Method:</strong> Meltwater unified retrieval, 2 Jul-29 Sep 2026, news/print; directional indexed mentions include syndication and are not deduplicated. Market is publisher country. China/Japan aggregate calls failed twice, so no volume is imputed; their qualitative read uses retrieved articles and current public validation. Temporary exact-search creation required approval and was not completed. Foreign weekly line excludes China/Japan. Tone is editorial framing, not automated sentiment.</div>
